19. Learned trial court has placed reliance on Sarabjit Singh & Anr. v. State of Punjab & Anr. AIR 2009 SC 2792, wherein while explaining the scope of Section 319 Cr.P.C., a two-Judge Bench of this Court observed as under:
"....For the aforementioned purpose, the courts are required to apply stringent tests;
one of the tests being whether evidence on record is such which would reasonably lead to conviction of the person sought to be summoned......
